Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Sessions
  proposal             enter details; a approve; x decline; A approve all after
                       confirmation
  1-5                  switch between Sessions, Graph, Quotas, Messages and
                       Tools
  up/down, j/k         select a session
  pgup/pgdn, home/end  page, first, last
  enter                enter the selected session (ctrl+] to return)
  e                    enter the selected session (alias for Enter)
  m                    send a message to the session as yourself
  n                    start a new session: project, harness, model, project
                       folder, first message (a form). Empty first message
                       starts it and enters it; text starts it in the background
                       and sends it.
  x, h, H              stop session; h hides/unhides; H shows hidden sessions
                       (dim)
  t                    cycle request rule: normal, ask, auto
  p                    delegation policy: subagent or worker for code changes (a
                       form)
  I                    integrations for all machines: 7 checkboxes (a form)
  more below
up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
